---
// MCP Integration Section.
//
// Tool list mirrors the server: one tool per CLI noun, verbs as actions.
---

<section id="mcp" class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0B0E14] to-violet-900/10">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-400 bg-violet-500/10 rounded-full border border-violet-500/20">
        AI-First
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Native to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Your agent can do everything the CLI can — one MCP tool per CLI noun — and reads and writes the same
        plan-of-record you see in <code class="mono text-violet-400">roady status</code>. Approving plans and accepting drift stay with you: your client asks, and nothing happens without your yes.
        One <code class="mono text-violet-400">roady setup</code> command per supported tool installs the MCP server and session hooks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
      <!-- The tools the agent actually calls -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center">
            <i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400 mr-2"></i>
            What the agent calls
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_next</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Brief for the current or next task</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_capture</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Record intent of any size in one write</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_task</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">start · complete · check · verify · dispatch · list</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_plan</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">import · generate · decompose · approve*</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_spec</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">add · explain · review · lock*</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_drift</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">detect · semantic · explain · accept*</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_status</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Where the plan stands</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_query</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Question over project state</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_audit</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">verify · trail</p>
            </div>
            <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-black/30 rounded-lg">
              <code class="text-violet-300 mono">roady_state · roady_git · roady_policy</code>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">get · rebuild* / sync / check</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
            * A decision: it runs only after you confirm it in your client. Thirteen tools, about 3k tokens of your agent's prompt.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center">
            <i data-lucide="settings-2" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mr-2"></i>
            Transports
          </h3>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
              <span class="text-gray-400">stdio (Claude Code, OpenCode)</span>
              <code class="text-xs mono text-emerald-300 bg-black/30 px-2 py-1 rounded">roady mcp</code>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
              <span class="text-gray-400">HTTP</span>
              <code class="text-xs mono text-emerald-300 bg-black/30 px-2 py-1 rounded">--transport http</code>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
              <span class="text-gray-400">WebSocket</span>
              <code class="text-xs mono text-emerald-300 bg-black/30 px-2 py-1 rounded">--transport ws</code>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- One-line setup + a real interaction -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="glass rounded-3xl p-2 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <div class="bg-[#0B0E14] rounded-2xl p-6 mono text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto">
            <div class="flex space-x-2 mb-4">
              <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-red-500/50 rounded-full"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-500/50 rounded-full"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-500/50 rounded-full"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-gray-500 mb-2"># One-command setup, per supported AI tool</div>
            <pre class="text-violet-300"><code>roady setup claude-code
roady setup codex
roady setup gemini
roady setup cursor
roady setup opencode
roady setup copilot
roady setup kiro</code></pre>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
              <div class="text-gray-500 mb-2">// Real interaction inside Claude Code</div>
              <div class="text-violet-400">You:</div>
              <div class="text-gray-300 ml-4">"What's blocked, and why?"</div>
              <div class="text-emerald-400 mt-3">Tool call:</div>
              <pre class="text-gray-300 ml-4"><code>roady_query &#123; question: "what is blocked?" &#125;</code></pre>
              <div class="text-emerald-400 mt-3">Tool call:</div>
              <pre class="text-gray-300 ml-4"><code>roady_next &#123;&#125;</code></pre>
              <div class="text-violet-400 mt-3">Claude:</div>
              <div class="text-gray-300 ml-4">2 blocked tasks. Both depend on auth-signup, which is still in_progress and its acceptance check is failing. Want me to pick it up?</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
